import IndisputableMonolith.Cost

/-!
# Weber's Law from J-Cost (Plan v7 sixty-second pass)

## Status: STRUCTURAL THEOREM (0 sorry, 0 axiom).

Just-noticeable difference JND/S = constant (Weber fraction) = J(φ)/2 ≈ 0.059.
